  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TelemetryVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=KN-IN: Next, choose whether or not you want to help Microsoft diagnose and fix issues.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TailoredVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=KN-IN: If you want tips, offers, and suggestions that are tailored to you, just select Accept.
